Heavy Metal is a animation, science fiction,
adventure film directed by Gerald Potterton.

3
00:12:16,363 --> 00:12:22,363
The embodiment of ultimate evil, a glowing orb terrorizes a young girl
with bizarre stories of dark fantasy, eroticism and horror.

4
